Title: Overall Survival With Pyrotinib Plus Capecitabine Versus Lapatinib Plus Capecitabine in HER2-Positive Metastatic Breast Cancer: A Single-Center Pooled Analysis.
Abstract: Phase II and III trials have demonstrated progression-free survival (PFS) benefits of pyrotinib plus capecitabine over lapatinib plus capecitabine in HER2-positive metastatic breast cancer (MBC). However, long-term overall survival (OS) data from a single-center cohort remain limited. This pooled analysis compared OS between the two regimens and explored outcomes across prespecified subgroups.

